	(text "THE 6845 AT 7800/7801 AND THE IDT7134 TEXT RAM" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 12.7 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "25f7112d-e6a7-56cd-bcf6-5c7091e5194b"))
	(text "The IDT7134's right port is the bus (2K: A11R low), its left port the 6845's refresh address MA0-MA11: no snow.\n6845 (HD68B45, the 2 MHz grade): -CS from IC5, RS = A0. E = NAND(-RDCRTC, -WRCRTC) (IC21C): the whole -MRD time on\na read, TPB within -MRW on a write. R/-W from IC24A: set while -MRD is low, cleared while -MRW is low, so it holds\nbetween cycles and never changes while E is high; a write latches as E falls." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "53898c13-73dc-5e8a-83d6-db4a5f8dab11"))
	(embedded_fonts no)
)
